(card "exp:baseline_C7.5_top3_no_open3min" :type "experiment"
  :subj "exp:baseline_C7.5_top3_no_open3min"
  :body "---\nnav: 9\ntype: experiment\nid: baseline_C7.5\nshort_name: baseline_top3_no_open3min\ntitle: \"baseline_C7.5 — top-3 expand + no_open_3min (R8 reproduce)\"\narc: 260516a\nteam: c\nround: r8\nparent_arc: \"[[arcs/260516a]]\"\nparent_lineage: \"[[lineages/arc_260516a__team_c__no_open3min]]\"\ntrain_nav: 3.0291\ntrain_trade_count: 170\ntrain_win_rate: 0.8941\ntrain_sharpe: 8.5918\ntrain_max_drawdown: -0.0047\nval_nav_mean: 1.0887\nval_nav_sigma: 0.0902\nval_window_count: 13\ntest_nav: 1.4058\ntest_trade_count: 31\ntest_sharpe: 7.7042\ntest_win_rate: 0.8065\ntest_max_drawdown: -0.0029\nanchor_train_nav: 2.1882\nanchor_test_nav: 1.2486\nstatus: baseline\noutcome: test_pass\nchampion: false\noverfit_score: 0\nleak_audit: clean\naxis: [whitelist, timing_filter, baseline]\npast_only_window_days: null\nwarmup_required: null\ncreated: 2026-05-17T01:30:00\nlast_updated: 2026-05-17T05:09:00\ntags: [arc/260516a, team/c, round/r8, axis/whitelist, axis/timing_filter, axis/baseline, status/baseline, outcome/test_pass, leak/clean, size/large]\n---\n\n# baseline_C7.5 — top-3 + no_open_3min (R8 reproduce)\n\n> **TL;DR** —— C7.5 的 R8 重跑作为 R8 round 的 reference baseline，保证 R8 系列每个候选都能与 R7 NAV champion 严格对比。**数字与 [[arc_260516a__team_c__C7.5__top3_no_open3min]] bit-for-bit 相同**。\n\n## 假设 (Hypothesis)\n- 不是 hypothesis，是 R8 round 的 reference reproduce。\n- C8.x 系列在 R8 内的 NAV gain 都应当 reference 本候选，而不是直接跨 round 比 C7.5（避免代码 helper drift）。\n\n## 实现 (Implementation)\n- 主脚本：R8 runner 直接调 R7 logic with same args.\n- trade selector = top-3 expand + drop minute_of_day in 开盘 3min.\n- 输出 170 笔，bit-for-bit 复现 C7.5。\n\n## Past-only window 处理\n- 无 rolling stat。`#leak/clean`。\n\n## 结果 (Results)\n| | NAV | Trades | Sharpe | Win | MaxDD |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| Train | 3.0291 | 170 | 8.59 | 89.4% | -0.47% |\n| Val (rolling 13w) | 1.0887 ± 0.090 | - | - | - | - |\n| Test | 1.4058 | 31 | 7.70 | 80.6% | -0.29% |\n\n## 风险 & overfit 嫌疑\n- N/A（reproduce baseline）。\n\n## Lineage（双链网）\n- **same_as**: [[arc_260516a__team_c__C7.5__top3_no_open3min]]\n- **reference_for_round**: 全 R8 C8.x candidates\n- **builds against**: [[arc_260516a__team_anchor__anchor_g2__baseline]]\n\n## Reports\n- `/Users/han/project/alpha/alpha_second_v1/arcs/all/260516a_agent_team_beat_current_sota/team_c/output/cross_round_leaderboard.csv` (baseline_C7.5)\n- [[arc_260516a__reporter_20260517_0547]]\n\n## Notes / 下次迭代\n- **方法论 lesson**：跨 round reproduce baseline 是 C 队的好实践 —— **任何 round 增量必须能 bit-for-bit 复现前 round champion**，否则 helper drift 导致 NAV gain 被错算。下次 sub-agent 启动新 round 必须照搬此约定。\n"
  :path "experiments/arc_260516a__team_c__baseline_C7.5__top3_no_open3min.md"
